OL,3,GNEWSAKemi Badenoch sets out the
OL,4,AConservative's pitch to London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe party conference season where
OL,7,Fpolitical party leaders and activists
OL,8,Fmeet every year continues with the
OL,9,FConservatives in Birmingham.
OL,11,FBBC London's political editor Karl
OL,12,FMercer is sitting down with leaders and
OL,13,Fother senior party figures to discuss
OL,14,Fsome of the key issues facing the
OL,15,Fcapital and what their party might do
OL,16,Fto tackle them.
OL,18,FLast week, he spoke to the leader of
OL,19,Fthe Conservative Party, Kemi Badenoch
OL,20,FMP, and asked about Brexit, Heathrow
OL,21,Fexpansion and her party's prospects in
OL,22,Fthe Holborn and St Pancras by-election.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
