OL,5,
OL,6,FKarl Mercer: The deadline has passed
OL,7,Ffor applications from people who want
OL,8,Fto be the Conservative candidate for
OL,9,Fmayor of London. Have you been
OL,10,Foverwhelmed with the number of people
OL,11,Fwho've applied?
